# Arxeio: public\assets\Announcements_docs\.gitignore
# Rolos: Krataei sto git mono ta aparaitita arxeia kai agnoei generated/uploads/dependencies.
# Simeiosi: Allages edo mporoun na epireasoun tin antistoixi selida i service pou to kanei include.
# Kratame ton fakelo sto git, alla oxi ta anevamena arxeia.
# Ta pragmatika docs einai uploads/periexomeno kai den prepei na mpenoun sto repository.
*
!.gitignore
